+| `make check-core-boundaries` | 0 | `.temp/TASK-260720-1qhxqa/core-boundaries-01.log` |
+| `make check-native-dependencies` | 0 | `.temp/TASK-260720-1qhxqa/native-dependencies-01.log` |
+| `swift build` | 0 | `.temp/TASK-260720-1qhxqa/swift-build-01.log`; existing `SecKeychainCopyDomainDefault` deprecation warning only |
+| `swift test --filter ProviderAdapterContractTests` | 0 | 14 tests passed |
+| `swift test --filter ReluxLibSSH2PackagingTests` | 0 | 3 tests passed |
+| `swift test --filter NativeDependencyPackagingTests` | 0 | 1 test passed |
