+| `TASK-260715-30zng6` | `TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md` — `c13bbb54a455da89f3e66121c81532b298eab73fac30b6d14d2e2df43fff8851` | `TASK-260715-30zng6_review.md` — `7a64ad098efd8cff52e0c6d144763b29e4d4008aab8e0967ce805c6134b0b756` | accepted 2026-07-20, date precision | current |
